  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "WAR is missing the Woodstox STAX XML processor JARs.  One sees \"javax.xml.stream.FactoryConfigurationError: Provider com.ctc.wstx.stax.WstxInputFactory not found\" in the Tomcat host log and the app. fails to start.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I manually downloaded woodstox-core-asl-4.2.0.jar and stax2-api-3.1.1.jar, copied them into WEB-INF/lib, and the app. was then able to start.  Possibly org.codehaus.woodstox/woodstox-core-asl is missing from the declared dependencies.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Gentoo Linux; Tomcat 7.0.42 from distro; fcrepo-webapp-4.0.0-beta-02-auth.war.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
