  "description": "<p>WAR is missing the Woodstox STAX XML processor JARs.  One sees \"javax.xml.stream.FactoryConfigurationError: Provider com.ctc.wstx.stax.WstxInputFactory not found\" in the Tomcat host log and the app. fails to start.</p>\n\n<p>I manually downloaded woodstox-core-asl-4.2.0.jar and stax2-api-3.1.1.jar, copied them into WEB-INF/lib, and the app. was then able to start.  Possibly org.codehaus.woodstox/woodstox-core-asl is missing from the declared dependencies.</p>",
